        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Privacy and infrastructure spotlights",
          "why": "Railgun and Commit-Boost episodes attracted strong engagement, suggesting readers use the show as an early-discovery surface for infrastructure and privacy-layer projects before mainstream coverage catches up."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "IRL access gated by token holdings",
          "why": "Tying ETHDenver ticket access to 1,000,000 Leviathan Points fused community loyalty mechanics with real-world exclusivity, driving clicks from readers curious whether they qualified."
